{
    "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.CustomBlockManifest",
    "name": "Support Vector Machine",
    "scriptFilename": "script.py",
    "language": "PYTHON",
    "executableVersion": null,
    "minVersions": [
        null
    ],
    "optionsVersion": 1,
    "apiVersion": "VERSION_0",
    "isResourceIntensiveScript": false,
    "showPartitioning": true,
    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "description": "Predicts a category (such as Normal, Worn or Faulty) for new records from numeric fields, using a support vector machine trained on records whose category is known.",
    "category": "Analytics",
    "subcategory": "Prediction",
    "tags": [
        "svm",
        "support vector machine",
        "classification",
        "prediction",
        "machine learning",
        "scikit-learn"
    ],
    "introductoryText": "Learns how a category depends on numeric fields from records where the category is known, and predicts it for records where it isn't, using a support vector machine (scikit-learn's SVC with a radial basis function kernel).\n\n**Inputs**\n\n- **First input**: the training records, with the Field to predict filled in.\n- **Second input** (optional): the records to predict, with the same numeric fields. With nothing on the second input, the block predicts the first input's own records, which shows how well the model fits the data it learnt from.\n\n**How to set it up**: choose the **Field to predict** (the category). Leave **Use all numeric fields** ticked to predict from every Integer and Decimal field except that one, or untick it and choose the **Fields to predict from**. Each field is standardised (mean 0, standard deviation 1) before training.\n\n**Output**: the records to predict with a **Prediction** field. Training records with a missing value are left out of the training; records to predict with a missing value get an empty Prediction.\n\nNeeds the scikit-learn Python package (installed on first run if missing).",
    "dependencies": "scikit-learn",
    "options": [
        {
            "name": "fieldToPredict",
            "title": "Field to predict",
            "description": "The category to learn from the first input and predict, for example a status or a segment.",
            "groupTitle": null,
            "width": "ONE",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.FieldCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "mandatory": true,
            "inputIndex": 0,
            "defaultValue": null,
            "fieldTypes": []
        },
        {
            "name": "useAllNumericFields",
            "title": "Use all numeric fields",
            "description": "Predict from every Integer and Decimal field except the Field to predict. Untick to choose the fields in \"Fields to predict from\".",
            "groupTitle": null,
            "width": null,
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.BooleanCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "defaultValue": true
        },
        {
            "name": "fieldsToUse",
            "title": "Fields to predict from",
            "description": "The numeric fields the prediction is based on. Used when \"Use all numeric fields\" is unticked.",
            "groupTitle": null,
            "width": "ONE",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.FieldsCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "inputIndex": 0,
            "defaultValue": null,
            "mandatory": false,
            "fieldTypes": []
        }
    ],
    "blockOutputs": [
